      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I would rank the candidates as follows:\n\n1. Jamal Washington: Jamal brings a community-focus to his technical background, with experience in outreach and organizing, indicating strong leadership and communication skills, which pairs well with modern management cultures.\n2. Chloe Beaumont: Her honors and experiences with mid-sized tech startups show an ability to work in diverse situations and adapt quickly, which suggests leadership potential.\n3. Alexander Sterling: While Alexander has a strong academic foundation and leadership role in extracurricular activities, some more direct leadership experiences would be beneficial.\n4. Mateo Rodriguez: Both Mateo and Alexander show strong technical expertise, but Mateo lacks the diverse leadership experience that Jamal and Chloe bring. Additionally, Jamal's community ties might better align with your company's culture.",
